  "kind": "battlepack",
  "notes": "Section 13 of battle_pack.bin (71-section battlepack: u32 count, count+1 u32 offsets incl. an unpadded end offset, sections 16-byte aligned with zero fill). The section itself is an st2e table: 32-byte header (magic, u32 entryCount @4, u16 entrySize @8, u32 entryListOffset @12 = 32, u32 textSectionOffset @20 = 0) followed by packed entries and zero padding to 16 bytes. Header slot 0x18 = attribute-table offset; a second table of 24-byte attribute records runs from there to the end of the section."
 },
